<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>1-800-LONELY-AF</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Dutch Melrose</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">1-800-LONELY-AF</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5RRajWBbubYzrURrDeFwP9</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Dutch Melrose"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Dutch Melrose"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">1-8-DOUBLE-O</p><p ttm:agent="v1">LONELY-AF</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You bet I wonder</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wonder how you're doing on your own</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sentimental</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Been sentimental waitin' by the phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Saw a future</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A future with you I won't ever know</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Guess I'm dying alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, what a lovely way to go</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cuz now you're just a memory (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You took the very best of me (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hate to admit I'd crawl right back (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you just call me at</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">1-800-LONELY-AF</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Why's it feel like everything we were ain't enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, won't you hit my line up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say it was love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My number is 1-800-LONELY-AF</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeahh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">1-8-DOUBLE-O</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">LONELY-AF</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I miss the drama</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I miss over-reacting over you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wishful thinking</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish we could of hid behind the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">At Delilah's</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When you said that you met somebody new</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And your father approves</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What the hell I'm supposed to do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When now you're just a memory (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You took the very best of me (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hate to admit I'd crawl right back (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you just call me at</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Hook]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">1-800-LONELY-AF</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Why’s it feel like everything we were</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ain’t enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh won’t you hit my line up</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say it was love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My number is 1-800-LONELY-AF</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeahh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">1-8-DOUBLE-O</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">LONELY-AF</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">1-8-DOUBLE-O</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">1-800-LONELY-AF</p></div></body></tt>